bout the tests of life and the importance of staying on the path of guidance.", "short_description": "Surah Al-Kahf contains powerful stories and lessons, including the People of the Cave, Prophet Musa and Khidr, and Dhul-Qarnayn. These narratives emphasize faith, patience, humility, and trust in Allah while reminding believers about the tests of life and the importance of staying on the path of guidance."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26361569610199072"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3450498551795834"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3450498551795834"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1775116260, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3450498551795834"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26361977483491618", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "959466826515417", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": 